--   problem with `select proname from pg_proc where pronamespace =
--   'public'::regnamespace` BEFORE reaching for a schema reload.
--
-- AFTER PASTING
--   Check the function list is complete, then point a client at the new
--   project and confirm RLS actually denies a cross-user read. A table created
--   without `enable row level security` looks like a working feature from the
